    "en": "Back on the highway after the stop, refreshed: drowsiness is only 40, fatigue 20, monotony has not yet rebuilt (35). AICA returns to an ordinary driving service and the same energize track tops again -- at a moderate fit, clearly below the pre-rest peak (0.276) but above the very first fresh-cruise reading (0.150). The arc has come full circle.",
